          "python",
          "Bad prompt:  \"Write something about dogs\"\nGood prompt: \"Write a 100-word product description for a GPS dog collar aimed at \n              first-time dog owners. Tone: friendly, reassuring. Include one \n              customer testimonial.\""
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "# Conceptually, the model does this:\n# P(next_word | \"The capital of France is\") \u2192 \"Paris\" (very high probability)\n# P(next_word | \"Write a poem about\")       \u2192 many possibilities (less constrained)\n\n# Your job: constrain the output space to get useful results"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502 ROLE:    \"You are a senior data scientist\"  \u2502  \u2190 Who the model should be\n\u2502 CONTEXT: \"Given this dataset summary...\"    \u2502  \u2190 Background information\n\u2502 TASK:    \"Identify the top 3 features\"      \u2502  \u2190 What to do\n\u2502 FORMAT:  \"Return as a numbered list\"        \u2502  \u2190 How to format output\n\u2502 CONSTRAINTS: \"Use only the provided data\"   \u2502  \u2190 Limitations\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518"
        ]
      ]
